<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">(a) </span>One-vs-Rest SVM: <math id="S1.F1.sf1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="c" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>c</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c</annotation></semantics></math> accesses</figcaption>
