<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 5: </span>Summary of notations.</figcaption>
<table id="A1.T5.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
